{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/0e52d0984ea8d726d97554f08c5eb395.poster.avif?t=1769792493\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/0e52d0984ea8d726d97554f08c5eb395.webm?t=1769792493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/0e52d0984ea8d726d97554f08c5eb395.mp4?t=1769792493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard's Oblation is a co-op game about cultist wizards who inhabit a hand-drawn world and worship the Bottomless Pit\u2014within which an unimaginable horror lurks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To avoid its wrath, the mages must offer up magical artifacts. To find them, they open portals to random, perilous locations teeming with magical creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every artifact you discover is a choice:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast a powerful spell,</strong> destroying the artifact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw it into the Pit,</strong> receiving a sphere of pure magic you can use again and again\u2014as long as you have mana.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade it to merchants</strong> for gold coins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pit accepts gold coins without hesitation, too\u2014but it gives nothing in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather enough offerings\u2014and you\u2019d better not find out what happens if the Pit is left hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/c1541b67fbc6be5611ab998b64c7a6f1.poster.avif?t=1769792493\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/c1541b67fbc6be5611ab998b64c7a6f1.webm?t=1769792493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/c1541b67fbc6be5611ab998b64c7a6f1.mp4?t=1769792493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893890?t=1769792493","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3893890?t=1769792493","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/2e44398cf2eec2f59228d420c5820021e89efe43/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769792493","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/2e44398cf2eec2f59228d420c5820021e89efe43/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769792493","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game includes surreal and grotesque enemy designs, a tense atmosphere, and spells that can kill both player characters and enemies."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/0e52d0984ea8d726d97554f08c5eb395.poster.avif?t=1769792493\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/0e52d0984ea8d726d97554f08c5eb395.webm?t=1769792493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/0e52d0984ea8d726d97554f08c5eb395.mp4?t=1769792493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizard's Oblation is a co-op game about cultist wizards who inhabit a hand-drawn world and worship the Bottomless Pit\u2014within which an unimaginable horror lurks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To avoid its wrath, the mages must offer up magical artifacts. To find them, they open portals to random, perilous locations teeming with magical creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every artifact you discover is a choice:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast a powerful spell,</strong> destroying the artifact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw it into the Pit,</strong> receiving a sphere of pure magic you can use again and again\u2014as long as you have mana.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trade it to merchants</strong> for gold coins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pit accepts gold coins without hesitation, too\u2014but it gives nothing in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather enough offerings\u2014and you\u2019d better not find out what happens if the Pit is left hungry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/c1541b67fbc6be5611ab998b64c7a6f1.poster.avif?t=1769792493\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/c1541b67fbc6be5611ab998b64c7a6f1.webm?t=1769792493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3893890/extras/c1541b67fbc6be5611ab998b64c7a6f1.mp4?t=1769792493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["LedenevTV"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Advent